[[Tyr the Skaald]] is a [[Norn]] Storyteller, whose duties include being a [[historian]] and a [[hero skill trainer]].

Tyr gives out empty [[Hero's Handbook]]s and [[Master Dungeon Guide]]s (both [[normal mode]] and [[hard mode]] versions) to characters. He also accepts filled books and gives the appropriate Norn rewards for them.

==Location==
* [[Far Shiverpeaks]]
** {{NPC location|Gunnar's Hold}} (up the hill at the southernmost point of the town)

