== Notes ==

* He automatically rewards you with the ability to use the [[Heart of the Norn]] effect if you speak to him after reaching at least Rank 1 in the Norn title track.
* He offers the same skills as [[Kodan]], who is also in Gunnar's Hold.

==Trivia==
* [[w:Tyr|Tyr]] is the god of single combat and heroic glory in Norse mythology, portrayed as a one-handed man.
* A [[w:Skald|Skald]] was a bard in the Viking age.
* During the preview weekend, Tyr's response when asked for a book was ''"I'm sorry. I don't have any books right now. Talk to me again in a week."''.
